#: src/odbcconfig.c:575
msgid ""
"Open DataBase Connectivity (ODBC) was developed to be an Open and portable "
"standard for accessing data. unixODBC implements this standard for "
"Linux/UNIX."
msgstr ""
"Open DataBase Connectivity (ODBC) es estat desvolopat per èsser un estandard "
"dobèrt e portable per l'accès a las donadas. unixODBC correspond a la "
"version Linux/UNIX d'aqueste estandard."

